    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa vira swiswi hukazungulukpwa ni kundi kulu ra mashaidi, nahuuseni chila chizingiti ambacho chinahuzuwiya, na hira dambi inayohugbwira dza mwiya wa chikpwata. Nahudiniseni kuzola mairo ambago ga mbere zehu kpwa kuvumirira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuno hunamlola Jesu ambaye anahulongoza humkuluphire Mlungu. Na ndiye ahutiyaye moyo kumarigiza go mashindano ga mairo. Iye wavumirira chifo msalabani bila kujali waibu kpwa ajili ya furaha yokala inamgodzera, na kusagala mkpwono wa kulume wa chihi cha chifalume cha Mlungu, phatu pha ishima kulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hebu phundzani vyo Jesu arivyopingbwa ni achina-dambi, ela ye achivumirira gosi. Phahi msivundzike mioyo na mkakata tamaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana hata ko kushindana kpwenu na tamaa za kuhenda dambi, tamdzangbwefika chiwango cha kuangamiza maisha genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.5.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ayubu 5:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.11+PRO.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Misemo 3:11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, gara maneno ambago Mlungu wagomba kukala mu anae, ili kukutiyani moyo, mkagayala? Mana Mlungu wagomba achiamba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
