              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 20:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakikishani munamphundza ye agombaye, mana akare enu arema kumphundza Musa ariyeaonya hipha duniani, nao achitiywa adabu kali. Naswi hakika hundatiywa adabu kali sana huchirema kumuogopha ye ahugombekezaye kula mlunguni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAG.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hagai 2:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo, Mlungu ariphogomba, sautiye yasumbisa dunia. Ela vivi walaga achiamba, “Ndasumbisa dunia tsona, ela safari ihi sindasumbisa dunia macheye, ndasumbisa hata ko mlunguni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neno hiri “tsona” rinaonyesa kukala vitu vyosi vyoumbwa himu duniani vindasumbiswa na kuuswa, ili visale vira visivyoweza kusumbiswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo nahumshukuruni Mlungu kpwa kuhupha ufalume usiosumbisika. Na hivyo humuabudu kpwa njira imuhamirayo, kpwa unyenyekevu na ishima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 4:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Mlungu wehu ni dza moho uochao tsetsetse!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.29"
            ]
          }
        }
